BIS:WS_CBPOL(1.0),M,MX,2022-01,5.5,368,0,,"From 21 Jan 2008 onwards: Central Bank target, money-market overnight rate; from 3 Nov 1998 to 20 Jan 2008: bank funding rate.",4,Bank of Mexico,"As from 21 Jan 2008, the central bank target rate is used, which can be considered the official policy rate. From 3 Nov 1998 until 20 Jan 2008: the bank funding rate. ", Central bank policy rates - Mexico - Monthly - End of period,A,F,
